0時になっちゃうワ オトナの時間
It's turning 12 o'clock, adult time!

143
00:41:38,229 --> 00:41:43,069
ド・キ・ド・キ・して rouge? まだ早い
Make my heart go dokidoki, rouge? Still too early.

144
